sequenceDiagram
    participant Feishu
    participant Webhook as router.py
    participant BG as BackgroundTasks
    participant LLM
    participant Push as execute_push

    Feishu->>Webhook: POST event
    Webhook->>Webhook: 校验 + 去重
    Webhook-->>Feishu: 200 OK (<100ms)
    Webhook->>BG: add_task
    BG->>Feishu: reply 思考中…
    BG->>LLM: 意图识别（如需）
    BG->>Push: 抽题 + 发送
    BG->>Feishu: reply 汇总
    Note over Feishu: 已 ACK，不再重试
